--- Calibration Advice ---
Engine SSCL fleet (132) is >15% above CHALO (98).
  Try: raise SSCL_TRUNK_HEADWAY_MIN, lower STOP_PENALTY_MIN, or relax CONGESTION_CITY_CORE.
Engine daily KM (full network) is >20% above CHALO SSCL KM — expected, since CHALO covers only 30 routes while engine covers 227.
